  "label": "Democrats granting rights to migrants is mapped onto the border-crossing scene",
  "description": "The top text 'democrats giving rights to those who have no right to be here' is analogically mapped onto the visual scene of migrants crossing a border fence. The meme equates the political action of granting rights to undocumented immigrants with the visual depiction of people physically crossing a border, implying that this action is somehow 'granting' them a right to be there, despite the text's claim that they 'have no right to be here'.",
